            "text/latex": "A data.table: 3 × 2\n\\begin{tabular}{ll}\n clase\\_ternaria & N\\\\\n <chr> & <int>\\\\\n\\hline\n\t CONTINUA & 162077\\\\\n\t BAJA+2   &   1304\\\\\n\t BAJA+1   &   1098\\\\\n\\end{tabular}\n",
